                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The h1 is “We couldn't find that page.” — never the numeral. The 404 numeral repeats the headline and carries no information, so it takes aria-hidden and is skipped by screen readers. The search input needs a visible or assistive label. Control borders use line-strong (#C9C9C4) for 3:1 against white.",
