                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "Ypry8",
                  "name": "Sole and leg length proposal artwork",
                  "context": "Review proposal in the approved hand illustration style. Side view of ONE lower leg in a tall plain white fencing sock, foot resting flat and pointing to the right. The knee and sock cuff above the knee are visible at the top, with a small edge of white fencing breeches. Show natural ankle, heel, calf and foot shape with gentle graphite shading and restrained fabric detail. No shoe. One thin crimson horizontal double-ended arrow BELOW the sole spans exactly from the back of the heel to the longest toe. One separate thin crimson vertical double-ended arrow to the LEFT of the leg spans from the heel level to the top of the sock above the knee. The arrows are outside the body and do not cross it. Exactly two arrows, no tape loops. Leave substantial blank space below the horizontal arrow for an editable A label and beside the vertical arrow for an editable B label, but DO NOT DRAW ANY LETTERS OR LABELS in the image itself. Full leg, foot and both arrows within the frame.",
                  "clip": true,
                  "width": 616,
                  "height": 493,
                  "fill": [
